        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12285999?u=183d27a6aca0718cb83ecec3c8e7745502384f48&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fixed typo in <code class=\"notranslate\">GPUCommandEncoder</code> documentation, changing \"recoded\" to \"recorded\" in the Examples section.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Corrects a technical inaccuracy in the WebGPU API documentation</li>\n<li>Improves clarity for developers learning GPU command buffer operations</li>\n<li>Addresses issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3006935920\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39203\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39203/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39203\">#39203</a> reported by community member</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/12285999/457536014-742b2d6c-8707-49f1-90ef-cae33a532fad.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..dT9a6GAUyg9qa7ZjDX-Wt8HFBEA5HYJwGb0LGkEWJUM\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/12285999/457536014-742b2d6c-8707-49f1-90ef-cae33a532fad.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..dT9a6GAUyg9qa7ZjDX-Wt8HFBEA5HYJwGb0LGkEWJUM\" alt=\"recorded\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a><br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/12285999/457536017-e3662f28-73e6-408a-be8a-b2d7f266e27a.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..yrCaezU5XUdG2jzl2hdFdY0NwtF0F0y9UU_rAy1ki7k\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/12285999/457536017-e3662f28-73e6-408a-be8a-b2d7f266e27a.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..yr